{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le17ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hello?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey Peter. How are you?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm great. How about you?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well ... I'm not sure. Ummm ... is Mercury in retrograde right now?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, it is. The retrograde lasts for about three weeks so we have a couple more days to go. Why do you ask?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I started thinking about what's been happening lately and I think the retrograde could have affected me after all.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? So you believe me?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le17ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, in the last two weeks a number of things have gone wrong. After you talked about the magnetic effect on electronic equipment, I recalled that my internet got really slow and my laptop was doing strange things. Also, my microwave oven went kaput. That can't all have been a coincidence. It must have been caused by the Mercury retrograde.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's likely that if we weren't in Mercury retrograde, all of that wouldn't have happened at the same time.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Also, you mentioned that it affects personal communication. I hired a new staff member last week. She signed a 3-month contract with me but I think she may not work out. She claimed that she had lots of experience but I'm beginning to doubt her. I explained that she would have to work weekends but now she's saying that she can't.", "id": 2, "time": "27000", "image": "engenn10le17ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, that could have been a bad idea. You don't want to embark on anything new if Mercury is in retrograde. If people do and say things that are out of character during this time, you have to take them with a grain of salt.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I should have taken this more seriously. You recommend that I not make any changes during the retrograde but I didn't heed your warning. Now I think I'm paying the price.", "id": 3, "time": "73500", "image": "engenn10le17ob09re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can discuss coincidences and strange events.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express and report opinions and beliefs. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can speculate about the past with different degrees of certainty.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When have you not taken advice from someone and later regretted it? What happened?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What kinds of things can affect how someone behaves?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"con